  "description": "Near modern Khostia/Prodromos in Boeotia, M\u00e1li is the modern name of a peak on a ridgeline where extensive remains of an ancient site, possibly a \"refuge site\" for the polis of Khorsiai, have been discovered. The population of Khorsiai are thought to have relocated back to the original nucleus of the community at nearby K\u00e1stron Khost\u00edon sometime in the early Archaic period.",
